# Ayaka Furina Escoffier Xianyun. ~24s Rot. Ayaka Cryo Plunge. 7 Cryo Plunges, 6 canceled with N1 to avoid the slow special dash. Xianyun does two skills per rotation, refreshing VV before Ayaka's second skill. 50% Collisions.

